---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Study in Cambodia. Graduate with an official UK Bachelor’s Degree
description: Study face to face in Phnom Penh, earn NCC Education qualifications and progress to a UK Bachelor’s degree validated and awarded by the University of Greater Manchester.
hideCta: false
---
{% from "partials/art.njk" import art, photo %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">NCC Education Accredited Partner Centre</p>
      <h1 class="h1">Study in Cambodia.<br>Graduate with an <span class="accent">official UK Bachelor’s Degree.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">Study face to face at the International Institute of Higher Education (IIHE) Cambodia in Phnom Penh, earn NCC Education qualifications and progress to the final online UK degree stage, with local support throughout.</p>
      <p class="lead">Choose Business Management or Software Engineering and build an international future without leaving Cambodia.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#consultation">Book a free consultation</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#programmes">Explore programmes</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="checks">
        <li>Free, no obligation</li>
        <li>Campus or online</li>
        <li>Khmer or English</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    {{ photo("students-classroom-group", "International students working together on a laptop in a lecture room", eager=true) }}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="trust-bar" aria-label="Key facts">
  <div class="container">
    <ul class="trust-list">
      <li>NCC Education Accredited Partner Centre</li>
      <li>British qualifications</li>
      <li>Study in Phnom Penh</li>
      <li>Progress to a UK degree</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/ncc-partner.njk" %}

{% include "partials/intake.njk" %}

<section class="section bg-soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">The opportunity</p>
        <h2 class="h2">You do not need to leave Cambodia for a UK degree</h2>
        <div class="split-photo">{{ photo("trainer-support", "A trainer helping a student with his work on a laptop") }}</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="body-lg">Studying overseas can mean high living costs, distance from family, a difficult move to a new country and the stress of changing requirements. IIHE Cambodia offers a more practical route.</p>
        <p class="body-lg">You study on our Phnom Penh campus in small classes, with qualified trainers, computer labs and an advisor who supports you from enrolment to graduation. You follow internationally recognised programmes and progress step by step towards a UK Bachelor’s degree, completing all four years in Cambodia.</p>
        <p class="pull">Our team supports you at every step towards your degree.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="prompt-row">
      <span>Comparing IIHE Cambodia with studying abroad? We will put the real numbers side by side with you.</span>
      <a class="text-link is-red" href="#consultation">Book a free consultation →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/step-founder.njk" %}

<section class="section bg-soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">How the partnership works</p>
      <h2 class="h2">One connected pathway, supported at every stage</h2>
      <p class="lead">IIHE Cambodia brings NCC Education’s British qualifications to students in Cambodia and manages the complete local learning experience.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <article class="card">
        <p class="kicker">Partner 01</p>
        <h3 class="h3">NCC Education: British qualifications and progression</h3>
        <p>NCC Education is a UK awarding body and global provider of British education, specialising in computing and business qualifications. It was established as a computing initiative by the British Government in 1966 and works with a global network of Accredited Partner Centres. NCC Education develops the programmes, provides the online learning materials and awards the Level 3, Level 4 and Level 5 qualifications.</p>
        <p>Through its university progression partnership, students who successfully complete Level 5 and meet the published entry conditions have a guaranteed route to the final online Bachelor’s degree stage.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card top-graphite">
        <p class="kicker">Partner 02</p>
        <h3 class="h3">IIHE Cambodia: teaching and support in Phnom Penh</h3>
        <p>IIHE Cambodia manages and supports your complete local study experience. We register you with NCC Education, provide qualified trainers, organise official assessments and examinations, monitor your academic progress and coordinate each stage of your journey.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card top-bluegrey">
        <p class="kicker">Final stage</p>
        <h3 class="h3">Final UK degree stage: online study with local support</h3>
        <p>The final top-up programme is validated and awarded by the University of Greater Manchester, and delivered online by Western International College Online (WINC). You can continue using the IIHE Cambodia campus and receiving local support while you study.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="prompt-row">
      <span>Want the partnership explained in Khmer, with your parents in the room? That is exactly what the consultation is for.</span>
      <a class="text-link is-red" href="#consultation">Book a free consultation →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="h2" style="margin-bottom:48px">What makes IIHE Cambodia unique</h2>
    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature">
        <h3 class="h4">A clear international pathway</h3>
        <p>Progress from NCC Education qualifications to a UK Bachelor’s degree through one structured pathway. IIHE Cambodia coordinates each stage of your academic journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <h3 class="h4">Personal support at every stage</h3>
        <p>Our trainers know your progress and provide practical support with lessons, assignments, exam preparation and study planning, from Foundation through to the final degree stage.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <h3 class="h4">Global learning, local care</h3>
        <p>Study at our Phnom Penh campus while accessing international programmes and online learning materials. You receive a British education pathway while staying close to your family.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="prompt-row">
      <span>Meet the trainers and see the campus before you decide. Visits take about 30 minutes.</span>
      <a class="text-link is-red" href="/book-a-consultation/?meeting=campus">Book a campus visit →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-dark" id="pathway">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head-row">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
        <h2 class="h2">Four clear stages to your UK Bachelor’s degree</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="text-link is-light" href="/fees-and-admissions/">See fees &amp; admissions</a>
    </div>
    {% include "partials/pathway.njk" %}
    <p class="fine-print">Successful completion of each stage is required before progression. Final-stage entry is subject to the published university requirements.</p>
    <div class="inset-cta">
      <p>Our admissions team will review your education background, suggest free tests in English and digital literacy, and explain the programmes, fees and next intake. The consultation is free.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#consultation">Book a free consultation</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="programmes">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Choose your programme</p>
      <h2 class="h2">Choose the future you want to build</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-2">
      {% for p in programmes %}
      <article class="programme-card">
        {{ photo(p.photo, p.photoAlt, false, sizes="(min-width: 960px) 50vw, 100vw") }}
        <div class="programme-body">
          <p class="kicker">{{ p.name }}</p>
          <h3 class="h3">{{ p.award }}</h3>
          <p>{{ p.summary }}</p>
          <ul class="mini-path">
            {% for s in p.path %}<li{% if loop.last %} class="is-final"{% endif %}><span>{{ s.stage }}</span><span>{{ s.qual }}</span></li>{% endfor %}
          </ul>
          <div class="btn-row">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ p.url }}">Explore programme</a>
            <a class="text-link" href="{{ p.url }}#right-for-you">Is it right for me? →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-soft">
  <div class="container split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Fees &amp; admissions</p>
      <h2 class="h2">A British degree, at a price built for Cambodia</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="body-lg">Fees are paid one stage at a time. You are never asked to commit to four years of tuition at once. See the full fee for each stage, who can apply and how to start your application.</p>
      <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:28px">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/fees-and-admissions/">See fees &amp; admissions</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#consultation">Get my fee schedule</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split" style="margin-bottom:52px">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow is-red">A first for Cambodia</p>
        <h2 class="h2">The complete British degree pathway, brought to Phnom Penh</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="body-lg">Getting a British Bachelor’s degree has often meant leaving Cambodia and paying overseas prices to do it. IIHE Cambodia is the first institute in the country to deliver the full NCC Education pathway, from Foundation through to a UK Bachelor’s degree, on a campus in Phnom Penh and at an affordable price.</p>
        <p class="body-lg">The opportunity is new. The qualification behind it is long established: NCC Education was established as a computing initiative by the British Government in 1966 and is recognised by Ofqual, the qualifications regulator in England, as an awarding body. Its qualifications are recognised by employers and universities across the globe, and Cambodian students can now study them at home.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="facts">
      <div class="fact"><div class="fact-num">1st</div><p>The first complete NCC Education degree pathway delivered in Cambodia, Foundation to final degree stage.</p></div>
      <div class="fact"><div class="fact-num">1966</div><p>The year NCC Education was established, as a computing initiative of the British Government: nearly six decades of experience behind your qualification.</p></div>
      <div class="fact"><div class="fact-num">UK</div><p>NCC Education is recognised by Ofqual, the qualifications regulator in England, as an awarding body of British qualifications.</p></div>
      <div class="fact"><div class="fact-num">90+</div><p>Universities, institutes and business schools worldwide offer progression routes from NCC Education diplomas.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="unis">
      <p class="kicker" style="margin:0">University progression</p>
      <div>
        <p style="margin-bottom:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--charcoal)">NCC Education diplomas have progression routes to more than 90 universities, institutes and business schools in countries including:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>United Kingdom</li>
          <li>Australia</li>
          <li>Canada</li>
          <li>Ireland</li>
          <li>Germany</li>
          <li>Japan</li>
          <li>New Zealand</li>
          <li>USA</li>
        </ul>
        <p>The IIHE Cambodia pathway leads to a Bachelor’s degree validated and awarded by the University of Greater Manchester and delivered online by Western International College Online (WINC). IIHE Cambodia is accredited by NCC Education, not by the university. NCC Education’s accreditations can be verified at <a href="https://www.nccedu.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">nccedu.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="prompt-row">
      <span>Be part of the first intake. Bring your questions about the awarding body and the degree, and we will show you the documentation.</span>
      <a class="text-link is-red" href="#consultation">Book a free consultation →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head-row">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Latest news</p>
        <h2 class="h2">Guidance for your next step</h2>
        <p class="lead" style="margin-top:16px">Short, practical information for students and parents.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/news/">View all news</a>
